   "cooked": "<h1>\n<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#tec-rewards-distribution-round-38-1\" name=\"tec-rewards-distribution-round-38-1\"></a>TEC Rewards Distribution - round-38</h1>\n<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>12 December 2023 and 1 January 2024</strong>. We allocated <strong>180.87</strong> TEC tokens for rewards.<br/>\nOut of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=12\" title=\":pray:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=12\" title=\":balance_scale:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=12\" title=\":memo:\" width=\"20\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://app.safe.global/home?safe=oeth:0xF2130236412b8f6Ed7B19fb9cE6f3F4B8dc12867\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=12\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\" width=\"20\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>USER IDENTITY</th>\n<th>TOTAL TO RECEIVE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>sem(減,雀)<span class=\"hashtag\">#0161</span>\n</td>\n<td>41.11452587</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eenti</td>\n<td>31.04088135</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Griff (凋,凋)<span class=\"hashtag\">#8888</span>\n</td>\n<td>23.48564797</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tamarandom</td>\n<td>21.48919227</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ygg_anderson#4998</td>\n<td>10.19077992</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>natesuits#4789</td>\n<td>7.350246434</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bear100#9085</td>\n<td>6.793853277</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gideonro</td>\n<td>10.02886537</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>maxwe11</td>\n<td>5.546459829</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Juankbell#7458</td>\n<td>5.329660761</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PhilH#1102</td>\n<td>5.095389958</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>paul2#3057</td>\n<td>3.982603645</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>divine_comedian</td>\n<td>2.921852308</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>missing username</td>\n<td>2.7131485</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>r33pich33p</td>\n<td>2.036442517</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JeffEmmett#7202</td>\n<td>0.9370832106</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JessicaZartler#2263</td>\n<td>0.8199478093</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div><p>You can check out the spreadsheet here with the calculations:</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://accounts.google.com/v3/signin/identifier?continue=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fspreadsheets%2Fd%2F1lpZvYeOAzO8s-gXp_IQoXxeFRvRg6tLvu_k1Vy7rNO8%2Fedit%3Fusp%3Dsharing&amp;followup=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fspreadsheets%2Fd%2F1lpZvYeOAzO8s-gXp_IQoXxeFRvRg6tLvu_k1Vy7rNO8%2Fedit%3Fusp%3Dsharing&amp;ifkv=ASKXGp19_ZykpgD2IwCtQ2pS5b53Z-1GZXqWsBfJ6NKVMJSKvMAa-pgSkDV-nJ-DgMX2dfiBPPy84A&amp;ltmpl=sheets&amp;osid=1&amp;passive=1209600&amp;service=wise&amp;flowName=GlifWebSignIn&amp;flowEntry=ServiceLogin&amp;dsh=S1644479286%3A1706303871927128&amp;theme=glif\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<a href=\"https://accounts.google.com/v3/signin/identifier?continue=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fspreadsheets%2Fd%2F1lpZvYeOAzO8s-gXp_IQoXxeFRvRg6tLvu_k1Vy7rNO8%2Fedit%3Fusp%3Dsharing&amp;followup=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fspreadsheets%2Fd%2F1lpZvYeOAzO8s-gXp_IQoXxeFRvRg6tLvu_k1Vy7rNO8%2Fedit%3Fusp%3Dsharing&amp;ifkv=ASKXGp19_ZykpgD2IwCtQ2pS5b53